{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/66wgvk","slideIndex":0,"text":"Source: user-provided planning figures. Annual gateway infrastructure and operations cost is below $100,000. Documentation cost is $35,000, assumed annual and additional to gateway costs. Kong three-year managed TCO is $800,000. 35,000 × 3 = 105,000. Current combined baseline is below 405,000, so incremental cost exceeds 395,000. The $105,000 is already reflected in this comparison and must not be deducted again. Current baseline excludes future AI additions. Catalogue replacement is conditional on scope, migration and actual cost retirement. Confirm full TCO inclusion of migration, integration, transition overlap and retained staff effort."}
