{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/hseqiy","slideIndex":1,"text":"Managed infrastructure, infrastructure operations and patching scope is supplied by the user and remains subject to the contract. Benefits are qualitative expectations, not measured savings. Spring Cloud Gateway is a gateway framework: the comparison includes the custom engineering and operations around the current implementation. Do not claim that Spring cannot proxy AI traffic. The current implementation lacks the additional AI management capabilities described in the conversation. Kong capability reference: https://developer.konghq.com/ai-gateway/ . Spring reference: https://docs.spring.io/spring-cloud-gateway/reference/index.html . Catalogue entitlement and replacement coverage require confirmation."}
